{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "092ecea0231e506ac583247829fec1b16326239590cced20959489c292c1f451", "ja": "（遊園地での、アイドル達のクリスマスのパレードが\n終わった。紗代子達、華やかだったな……）", "zh": "（在游乐园举办的偶像圣诞节游行结束了。\n纱代子她们的演出十分华丽……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1001_p", "source_sha256": "146aab50dfa17de06d64b2bc2f696596f070853239f8507af4daadd37a7a5b78", "ja": "紗代子、クリスマスパレードお疲れさま……。", "zh": "纱代子，圣诞游行辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "8f8b22932bcf563af860704d3cac8ec6caec1329c1daf3d8b3fadfb15f664a59", "ja": "{$P$}！\nあのっ、本当に……本当にすみませんでした！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n那个，真的……真的很对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4dee83cf75ad55d9309fb548bbc992a7aa2e28123de107aa5c7773861cc6400f", "ja": "ど、どうした？　紗代子。\n何かあったのか？", "zh": "怎、怎么了，纱代子？\n发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "c9672cf20b2e1b6ff0b5f783271a1fabee76e07dde74b35d3094cc008f144d99", "ja": "だ、だって私……お仕事なのに、パレードが\n楽しくて、テンションが上がっちゃって……。", "zh": "因、因为……我明明应该认真工作，\n却因为游行太开心，兴致整个高昂起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "ffe52e80fc1a8bfe7366f79a254809ea951c1c5024d2f2d460a29c6f2d33c76f", "ja": "手を振りすぎて、フロート車から2回も落ちそうに\nなるし。その後の振り付けも間違えるし……！", "zh": "结果挥手挥得太用力，有两次差点从花车上摔下来。\n之后的舞步也跳错了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cde263acc9f0b2d1bbe2f977d0883497eb4549365d55d23e4395c985bfd36002", "ja": "ああ、ちょっとヒヤッとしたよ。でも安全確認は\nキッチリしてるから、簡単に落ちたりしないけどな。", "zh": "是啊，看得我都捏把冷汗。\n不过安全措施做得很确实，没那么容易掉下来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "b60df18c50db29b3a50de2c57d854b98ae4feb4aae6602b1894a8dc57cf0e94f", "ja": "はい。でも{$P$}やスタッフさんを、\n慌てさせてしまったと思います。本当にすみません！", "zh": "嗯，可是我想还是害{$P$}\n和工作人员担心了吧？真的很抱歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "5d8fc01e6339ee70c47bdfdee88d4cb330ec361b6149dcb05bd4815124979cd2", "ja": "何より、完成度の低いものをお客さんに見せて\nしまって……私、アイドル失格です！", "zh": "最不应该的，是让观众看到水准低落的表演……\n我没有资格当偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b19bd29259133aaa522b7afbce9f2bc524cb3fdc69a791284a2b91531b467014", "ja": "アイドル失格は大げさだと思うけど……。\nでも確かに、今日の紗代子は紗代子らしくなかったな。", "zh": "我是觉得还不到没资格这么严重……\n不过，今天的纱代子的确有点失常。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "6735015537eb99838221309c774fa0616995fc4720050e661241b7c0d0eec1ca", "ja": "や、やっぱり……！", "zh": "果、果然……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a813d2f1cb8b0b383fa2114de6439e2f171999d3dd5518d32e96524c24bc94ff", "ja": "いや、悪い意味じゃなくて……\n今日の紗代子には、いつもの固さが全然なかった。", "zh": "不，这不是批评……\n我觉得今天的纱代子不像平常那么一本正经。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1012_p", "source_sha256": "df737a3a858163d4ccfbf64252f8f67aac6cee3f7ae833806eafedd91e9c5a52", "ja": "パレードを心から楽しんでいるのが、見ていて\nよくわかったよ。ファンの人達にも伝わったと思う。", "zh": "可以看得出你真心享受着这场游行，\n我想粉丝们也都感受到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "c15287e32e780c2340172ad37a5329e093a9634ad168bd9009984f15215037df", "ja": "そ、それは……だって、クリスマスの夜に\nパレードの主役だなんて、すごいことですし。", "zh": "那、那是……因为，在圣诞夜担任游行的主角，\n是很不得了的一件事嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "db5054ddf7264ecf6e1dec8d713e25d6e22cf6caa328d9b9cf3eae4cd3723d5c", "ja": "本当にうれしくて、\nつい、はしゃいじゃったというか……。", "zh": "我真的好开心，\n所以一不小心就兴奋过头……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "2735708f9aeff23698d24c34362f370bdd280e491000fffdda07f93d000397c8", "ja": "うう、恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "呜呜，好丢脸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f0a95c3ecaef7629ab4b0ec5b948e1ea50aee7c9c40c55757294844d7ca8ba53", "ja": "そんなに恥ずかしがらなくても……\nお客さんにはちゃんと届いてたから、大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "不用觉得丢脸啦……\n观众应该也都感受到了，没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "8900573fe4632be5eae9a24ef0112b21e2c140cc3460fd894276f53d446a640f", "ja": "ほ……本当ですか？", "zh": "真……真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d6fa7eaa5ece733490ed0b44a290a424da8f61354c6a5bdc5a28b395fd2dfa84", "ja": "ああ。みんな、素敵なクリスマスの思い出に\nなったと思う。お疲れさま、紗代子！", "zh": "是啊，我想大家应该都有留下很棒的圣诞节回忆。\n辛苦你了，纱代子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "54916e2d592273fcc0f9ea933261e70a6ba878729c5998525417c0de380fc09a", "ja": "{$P$}……そうですよね。\nみんなの、思い出になったなら……。", "zh": "{$P$}……你说得对。\n如果能为大家留下回忆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "882fe00312d76f335b0519252d7c7bba5e78cd6a72652db325524edc28f1ae85", "ja": "ふふ、私からも……クリスマスに、最高の舞台へ\n連れて来てくれて、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "呵呵，我也要谢谢你……\n在圣诞节带我来到这么棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0094_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "6a4172e09e6ebc8714382d9caa6ef973efdccb348a271814a41c780ccd23ad45", "ja": "これからも、みんなと素敵な思い出が増えるように、\nたくさんがんばりますね！　ふふっ！", "zh": "接下来我要加倍努力，\n继续和大家创造美好的回忆！呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
